          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "RHOMBUS\nThis node generates a rhombus shape with adjustable width and height.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• Both sine oscillators run from 0.3 to 0.8 and back.\n• The second sine oscillator is out of phase with the first oscillator. This is done by setting the phase offset to 0.5\n• The oscillators modulate the width and height of the Rhombus.\n• The Shape Render is used to convert the Shape2D to and texture.\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
